C(340,'thermal','連續焊軌中性溫度約束與位移證據~Neutral temperature restraint and displacement evidence in welded rail',
 '連續鋼軌的熱伸縮被扣件與道床約束，軌溫與應力自由溫度的差才是熱力判斷的起點；軌道橫向阻力及初始不整也影響穩定性~Fastenings and ballast restrain thermal rail movement; the difference between rail temperature and stress-free temperature starts the force assessment, while lateral resistance and initial misalignment also govern stability',
 '低載模型鋼條、溫度計與位移計~low-load model bars, thermometers and displacement gauges',
 '線彈性鋼條與已知約束，不提供營運鋼軌切割或拉伸程序~a linear-elastic bar with known restraints, not instructions for cutting or stretching operational rails',
 '''自由鋼軌伸長~Free rail expansion | alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; L[m]=100; dT[K]=20 | alpha*L*dT*1000 | mm | 無約束鋼軌可以以長度變化釋放熱應變~Unrestrained rail releases thermal strain through a change in length | 軌溫和端部位移~rail temperature and endpoint displacement | 局部卡阻會破壞自由伸長假設~Local binding invalidates free-expansion behavior
全約束熱應力~Fully restrained thermal stress | E[GPa]=210; alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; dT[K]=25 | E*1000*alpha*dT | MPa | 完全約束下軸向熱應變轉成應力~Full axial restraint converts thermal strain into stress | 軌溫與可追溯應變~rail temperature and traceable strain | 中性溫度估錯會讓應力估計整體偏移~Incorrect neutral temperature shifts the full stress estimate
熱軸力換算~Thermal axial-force conversion | sigma[MPa]=60; A[mm2]=7600 | sigma*A/1000 | kN | 軸力等於平均應力乘有效斷面，左右兩軌須分別核對~Axial force equals mean stress times effective area, with each rail checked separately | 斷面損耗與軸向應變~section loss and axial strain | 磨耗斷面仍沿用新軌面積會誤算軸力~Using new-rail area for worn rail miscalculates force
軌溫量測誤差~Rail-temperature error propagation | E[GPa]=210; alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; uT[K]=2 | E*1000*alpha*uT | MPa | 溫度誤差經彈性係數直接傳到熱應力估計~Temperature error propagates through stiffness into thermal-stress estimation | 兩種接觸式溫度量測~two contact-temperature measurements | 單側日照造成的溫差會讓表面溫度失去代表性~One-sided sunshine makes a surface temperature unrepresentative
扣件阻力累積~Fastening resistance accumulation | r[kN/m]=8; L[m]=30 | r*L | kN | 均勻分布縱向阻力積分後形成可傳遞軸力的量級~Integrating uniform longitudinal resistance gives a transferable-force scale | 沿線相對滑移~relative slip along the line | 把滑動後阻力視為初始彈性剛度會混淆機制~Confusing post-slip resistance with initial elastic stiffness mixes mechanisms
溫差等效位移~Temperature-equivalent displacement | alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; L[m]=80; dT[K]=12 | alpha*L*dT*1000 | mm | 等效熱位移只能在指定長度與邊界下解讀~Equivalent thermal movement is meaningful only for the stated length and boundaries | 標距及基準端點~gauge length and reference endpoints | 標距縮短後沿用原位移會放大推算溫差~Using the old displacement with a shorter gauge exaggerates inferred temperature change
中性溫差反算~Neutral-temperature difference inversion | strain[1]=0.000115; alpha[1/K]=0.0000115 | strain/alpha | K | 應變反算溫差必須先分離機械與熱補償項~Inferring temperature difference from strain requires separating mechanical strain and temperature compensation | 補償應變計與獨立溫度~compensated strain gauges and independent temperature | 儀器熱漂移會被誤認為中性溫度改變~Instrument thermal drift can resemble a neutral-temperature change
截面溫度梯度~Cross-section temperature curvature | alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; dT[K]=8; h[m]=0.17 | alpha*dT/h | 1/m | 線性溫度梯度可形成自由熱曲率，平均溫度不含這項資訊~A linear thermal gradient creates free thermal curvature that mean temperature does not describe | 軌頭與軌底溫度~rail-head and rail-foot temperatures | 平均溫度正常仍可能有差異熱彎曲~A normal mean temperature can coexist with differential thermal bending
彈性釋放位移~Elastic release displacement | F[kN]=300; L[m]=50; E[GPa]=210; A[mm2]=7600 | F*1000*L/(E*1e9*A*1e-6)*1000 | mm | 軸向彈性位移由軸力、長度與軸向剛度共同決定~Axial elastic movement depends on force, length and axial rigidity | 模型載入卸載位移~loading-unloading movement in the model | 支承滑移會使量到的位移不再全是彈性伸長~Support slip means measured movement is not wholly elastic
軌斷缺口量級~Broken-rail gap scale | alpha[1/K]=0.0000115; L[m]=40; dT[K]=30 | alpha*L*dT*1000 | mm | 釋放長度與溫差共同決定簡化缺口量級~Released length and temperature difference jointly determine a reduced gap scale | 缺口附近位移剖面~displacement profile near a gap | 只以缺口大小推算整條線軌應力並不唯一~A gap size does not uniquely determine stress along an entire line''')

C(341,'material','電阻熱頂鍛幾何與焊接品質證據~Resistance heating upset geometry and weld-quality evidence',
 '閃光對焊把電熱輸入、接合面狀態與頂鍛塑性變形串接；焊後外觀平順只是幾何條件，不能單獨證明熱影響區與內部接合品質~Flash-butt welding couples electrical heat input, interface condition and upset deformation; a smooth finished profile is a geometric condition and alone does not prove heat-affected-zone or internal bond quality',
 '合成電流電壓紀錄、溫度曲線與檢測試塊~synthetic current-voltage records, temperature traces and inspection blocks',
 '簡化熱電材料帳，所有數值非焊機設定或生產配方~simplified thermal-electrical accounts; values are not welding-machine settings or production recipes',
 '''電阻熱積分~Resistance-heat integration | I[A]=5000; R[ohm]=0.0001; t[s]=2 | I**2*R*t/1000 | kJ | 焦耳熱與電流平方相關，電阻隨溫度和接觸狀態改變~Joule heat depends on current squared while resistance changes with temperature and contact state | 同步電流電壓波形~synchronized current and voltage waveforms | 用平均電流平方代替均方電流會低估脈動熱輸入~Squaring mean current understates heating from a fluctuating current
電功率帳核對~Electrical power cross-check | V[V]=4; I[A]=5000 | V*I/1000 | kW | 接頭電壓乘電流給出局部電功率，不能包含無關導線壓降~Joint voltage times current gives local electrical power and must exclude unrelated cable drops | 接頭四線式電壓量測~four-terminal voltage measurements across the joint | 量測點過遠會把電纜損耗算進接頭熱量~Distant voltage taps count cable loss as joint heat
頂鍛平均壓力~Mean upset pressure | F[kN]=450; A[mm2]=7600 | F*1000/A | MPa | 軸力除面積是平均頂鍛壓力，不等於接觸面每處應力~Axial force divided by area is mean upset pressure, not local contact stress everywhere | 力位移同步曲線~synchronized force-displacement curves | 對中不良會使壓力偏心與塑性流動不均~Misalignment produces eccentric pressure and uneven plastic flow
頂鍛作功估計~Upset-work estimate | F[kN]=400; d[mm]=4 | F*d | J | 近似定力作功是力乘行程，塑性熱與外部散熱仍須分帳~Approximate constant-force work multiplies force by travel; plastic heat and external loss remain separate | 行程零點與載荷~travel zero and load | 液壓機構彈性位移會被誤算成接頭塑性位移~Hydraulic elastic displacement can be mistaken for joint plastic displacement
熱影響區顯熱~Heat-affected-zone sensible heat | m[kg]=1.5; c[J/kgK]=600; dT[K]=700 | m*c*dT/1000 | kJ | 顯熱量級不包含相變與溫度依賴比熱~Sensible-heat scale excludes phase change and temperature-dependent heat capacity | 熱影響區範圍與溫度~heat-affected-zone extent and temperature | 均溫假設會掩蓋近界面梯度~A uniform-temperature assumption hides near-interface gradients
平均冷卻速率~Average cooling rate | dT[K]=240; dt[s]=60 | dT/dt | K/s | 區間平均冷卻速率不等於所有時刻的冷卻速率~An interval-average cooling rate is not the rate at every instant | 完整冷卻曲線~the complete cooling trace | 單一平均值會掩蓋局部快速冷卻~One average hides locally rapid cooling
焊頭垂向角差~Weld vertical angular mismatch | dz[mm]=0.3; L[m]=1 | dz/(L*1000)*1000 | mrad | 端部角差造成通過時幾何激振，表面研磨不能修復所有內部偏心~Angular mismatch excites passing wheels geometrically, and surface grinding cannot correct every internal eccentricity | 兩側直尺與縱向剖面~straightedge readings and longitudinal profiles on both sides | 短尺平順可能漏掉較長波長折角~A short straightedge can miss a longer-wavelength angular defect
斷面偏心彎矩~Section-eccentricity bending moment | F[kN]=200; e[mm]=0.5 | F*e | N*m | 軸力作用線偏離截面中心會附加彎矩~An axial-force line offset from the centroid adds bending moment | 軸線對中與偏移~axial alignment and offset | 忽略微小偏心會低估接頭彎曲~Ignoring a small eccentricity understates joint bending
硬度相對差異~Relative hardness difference | H1[HV]=300; H2[HV]=250 | (H1-H2)/H2*100 | percent | 硬度差反映局部材料狀態，但不直接等同疲勞壽命差~Hardness variation reflects local material state but does not directly equal a fatigue-life difference | 等距硬度剖面與位置~equally spaced hardness profiles and positions | 只測焊縫中心會漏掉較軟熱影響區~Testing only the weld centre misses a softer heat-affected zone
檢測覆蓋比例~Inspection coverage fraction | covered[mm]=140; total[mm]=160 | covered/total*100 | percent | 幾何覆蓋比例描述檢測範圍，不能直接當成缺陷檢出機率~Geometric coverage describes inspection extent and is not probability of detection | 探頭聲束覆蓋圖~probe beam-coverage maps | 把覆蓋率當檢出率會誇大檢測能力~Equating coverage with detection probability exaggerates inspection capability''')

C(342,'material','現場接頭熱量收縮形貌與無損檢測~Field-joint heat shrinkage profile and nondestructive inspection',
 '鋁熱焊課程只分析接頭能量、凝固收縮與焊後驗證；化學配方、點火及現場操作均不由教學模型指定，重點是辨認外觀與內部品質的差異~This aluminothermic-weld course analyses joint energy, solidification shrinkage and post-weld verification; it specifies no chemical recipe, ignition or field procedure, and distinguishes visible profile from internal quality',
 '合成熱曲線、接頭輪廓與超音波試塊~synthetic thermal traces, joint profiles and ultrasonic calibration blocks',
 '已給定熱量的材料帳，不涉及反應配方或施工操作參數~a material account with already specified heat input, excluding reaction recipes and work settings',
 '''接頭金屬質量~Joint metal mass | rho[kg/m3]=7800; V[m3]=0.0008 | rho*V | kg | 密度乘有效體積可核對材料帳，外部餘料需分開~Density times effective volume checks the material account, keeping external surplus separate | 接頭幾何與有效體積~joint geometry and effective volume | 外部餘料混入有效體積會高估接頭補入量~Including surplus in effective volume overstates useful joint fill
接頭顯熱量級~Joint sensible-heat scale | m[kg]=5; c[J/kgK]=600; dT[K]=500 | m*c*dT/1000 | kJ | 顯熱只描述溫度變化，凝固潛熱必須另列~Sensible heat describes temperature change; latent heat of solidification is separate | 質量與溫度歷程~mass and temperature history | 忽略潛熱會誤判冷卻時間~Omitting latent heat misjudges cooling duration
凝固潛熱帳~Solidification latent-heat account | m[kg]=5; latent[kJ/kg]=270 | m*latent | kJ | 相變放熱可以在溫度變化很小時持續發生~Phase-change heat can be released while temperature changes little | 冷卻曲線平台~a plateau in the cooling trace | 把平台當成感測器故障會漏掉相變效應~Mistaking a plateau for sensor failure misses phase-change behavior
體積收縮量~Volume-shrinkage estimate | V[cm3]=800; frac[1]=0.03 | V*frac | cm3 | 總收縮量不能單獨決定縮孔位置，補縮路徑與冷卻次序也重要~Total shrinkage does not determine pore location; feeding paths and cooling order matter | 內部孔隙分布~distribution of internal voids | 冷卻不均可能把收縮集中成缺陷~Uneven cooling can concentrate shrinkage into a defect
線性熱收縮量~Linear thermal contraction | alpha[1/K]=0.000012; L[mm]=40; dT[K]=300 | alpha*L*dT | mm | 固態冷卻收縮與凝固體積收縮屬不同階段~Solid-state thermal contraction and solidification shrinkage occur in different stages | 降溫後幾何變化~geometry change after cooling | 把兩種收縮重複相加會高估位移~Double counting the two shrinkage stages overestimates movement
等效導熱通量~Equivalent conductive heat flux | k[W/mK]=35; dT[K]=200; L[m]=0.05 | k*dT/L | W/m2 | 一維熱流與溫度梯度成正比，有限接頭不是永久穩態~One-dimensional heat flux scales with temperature gradient, but a finite joint is not permanently steady | 多位置溫度差~temperature differences at several positions | 用穩態熱流外推全部冷卻過程會失真~Extending a steady flux over the entire cooling history distorts energy
孔隙面積比例~Void area fraction | avoid[mm2]=12; area[mm2]=800 | avoid/area*100 | percent | 切片孔隙面積率不能直接當作三維缺陷體積率~A section void-area fraction is not directly a three-dimensional void-volume fraction | 多切面或不同聲束觀察~multiple sections or different beam views | 單一切面可能避開主要縮孔~One section can miss the main shrinkage void
有效斷面應力~Effective-section stress | F[kN]=300; A[mm2]=7600; lost[mm2]=100 | F*1000/(A-lost) | MPa | 淨截面應力只描述平均量，不包含缺陷尖端應力集中~Net-section stress describes an average and excludes defect-tip concentration | 缺陷尺寸與軸向載荷~defect dimensions and axial load | 小面積裂紋仍可能產生高局部應力~A small-area crack can still generate high local stress
焊頂輪廓坡度~Weld crown profile slope | h[mm]=0.2; L[mm]=100 | h/L*1000 | mrad | 輪廓斜率將表面高差和過渡長度連結~Profile slope links surface height difference with transition length | 接頭連續縱向掃描~continuous longitudinal scans across the joint | 同高差在更短距離內形成更尖銳激振~The same height difference over a shorter distance creates sharper excitation
檢測掃描間距~Inspection scan spacing | v[mm/s]=50; f[Hz]=100 | v/f | mm | 掃描速度除量測頻率給出沿程點距，細點距仍不保證可檢出~Scan speed divided by acquisition rate gives spatial spacing, though fine spacing alone does not guarantee detection | 編碼器與取樣時間戳~encoder positions and sampling timestamps | 編碼器打滑會讓名義覆蓋與實際覆蓋不符~Encoder slip separates nominal coverage from actual coverage''')

C(343,'material','道碴重排支承恢復與幾何保真~Ballast rearrangement support recovery and geometry fidelity',
 '搗固把道碴重新配置到軌枕下方以恢復支承，起道後的幾何和重載後的幾何並非同一件事；必須把短期整正與長期沉陷追蹤連在一起~Tamping rearranges ballast beneath sleepers to restore support, but geometry immediately after lifting differs from geometry after traffic; short-term correction must therefore be connected with settlement monitoring',
 '顆粒模型、模型力計與重複水準剖面~granular models, model force gauges and repeated level profiles',
 '教學顆粒體與低載模型，不提供營運軌道搗固設定~teaching granular specimens and low-load models, not operating track-tamping settings',
 '''搗固循環產能~Tamping cycle productivity | sleepers[count]=2; cycle[s]=8 | sleepers*3600/cycle | sleepers/h | 單循環處理數乘循環頻率只是理想產能~Units per cycle times cycle frequency gives ideal productivity only | 實際循環與停機時間~actual cycles and downtime | 忽略定位與等待會高估施工產能~Omitting positioning and waiting overstates productivity
軌枕底空隙量~Under-sleeper void volume | A[m2]=0.5; gap[m]=0.004 | A*gap*1000 | litre | 面積乘平均空隙描述需重新支承的體積量級~Area times average gap describes the volume scale requiring renewed support | 支承接觸與空隙剖面~support contact and gap profile | 平均空隙會掩蓋局部懸空~An average gap hides local unsupported regions
擠壓平均接觸壓~Mean squeeze contact pressure | F[kN]=8; A[m2]=0.02 | F/A | kPa | 平均壓力不能代表個別顆粒接觸點壓力~Mean pressure does not represent individual grain-contact pressure | 力與接觸範圍~force and contact extent | 顆粒破碎會改變粒徑與長期支承~Grain crushing changes grading and long-term support
模型擠壓作功~Model squeeze work | F[N]=800; x[m]=0.02 | F*x | J | 力位移積分描述機械輸入，並非全部能量都用於有效重排~Force-displacement integration describes mechanical input, but not all energy produces useful rearrangement | 力位移迴圈~force-displacement loops | 無效摩擦耗能會使高作功不代表高品質~Unproductive friction means high work does not prove quality
振動週期次數~Vibration cycle count | f[Hz]=35; t[s]=1.2 | f*t | cycles | 頻率乘持續時間給出循環次數，不等同填充程度~Frequency times duration gives cycle count, not degree of filling | 振動與填充位移~vibration and filling movement | 重複振動可能只磨耗顆粒而未改善支承~Repeated vibration may abrade grains without improving support
起道量分配~Lift allocation | target[mm]=12; existing[mm]=4 | target-existing | mm | 目標與現況差值需同一高程基準~Target-minus-existing lift requires a common elevation datum | 整正前後同基準高程~before-and-after levels on the same datum | 基準移動會使起道量失真~A moving datum corrupts the inferred lift
整正後回沉率~Post-correction settlement ratio | settled[mm]=3; lift[mm]=12 | settled/lift*100 | percent | 回沉比例描述短期保留量，不預測無限期穩定~Settlement fraction describes short-term retention and does not predict indefinite stability | 通車荷載量與高程趨勢~traffic loading and elevation trend | 未記錄通過噸位會讓不同觀測期不可比較~Missing traffic tonnage makes observation periods incomparable
道碴橫向排水~Ballast lateral drainage scale | k[m/s]=0.002; A[m2]=0.8; i[1]=0.02 | k*A*i*1000 | litre/s | 達西量級只適用假設滲流範圍，堵塞會改變等效滲透率~A Darcy estimate applies only to its assumed flow regime; clogging changes effective permeability | 水頭差與排出流量~head difference and discharged flow | 細料累積會使整正後仍持續軟化~Fines accumulation can sustain softening after geometric correction
支承剛度回復~Support stiffness recovery | F[kN]=40; delta[mm]=1.6 | F/delta | kN/mm | 載重位移斜率描述支承剛度而非單純高度~Load-displacement slope characterizes support stiffness rather than height alone | 重複模型載重曲線~repeated model loading curves | 同一高程可能隱藏不同承載剛度~The same elevation can conceal different support stiffnesses
幾何殘差均方根~Geometry residual RMS | e1[mm]=1; e2[mm]=-2; e3[mm]=2 | sqrt((e1**2+e2**2+e3**2)/3) | mm | 均方根保留誤差幅度，但仍須檢查局部峰值~RMS retains error magnitude but local peaks still require inspection | 逐點殘差與位置~pointwise residuals and positions | 單一平均品質指標會掩蓋尖峰缺陷~One average quality score hides localized defects''')

C(344,'material','粒徑分離再利用物料帳與排水性能~Gradation separation reuse mass accounts and drainage performance',
 '清篩將受污染道碴分成可再用粗料與廢細料，回收比例不能取代粒形、強度及排水驗證；含水率和顆粒損傷會影響質量帳的解讀~Cleaning separates fouled ballast into reusable coarse material and discarded fines, but recovery fraction cannot replace checks on particle shape, strength and drainage; moisture and particle damage affect the mass account',
 '教學篩組、秤重資料與低水頭滲流模型~teaching sieves, weighing records and low-head permeameter models',
 '乾質量守恆與穩態流程假設，不指定現場篩網或機械操作值~dry-mass conservation and steady processing, without specifying field screens or machine settings',
 '''清篩質量守恆~Cleaning mass conservation | feed[t]=100; coarse[t]=72; fines[t]=25 | feed-coarse-fines | t | 輸入減已知輸出應對應存量變化與量測差~Input minus known outputs corresponds to inventory change and measurement discrepancy | 各料流同步乾質量~synchronized dry mass in each material stream | 未記錄存料會把正常暫存當成損耗~Unrecorded inventory makes temporary storage appear as loss
可再用材料比例~Reusable material fraction | reusable[t]=72; feed[t]=100 | reusable/feed*100 | percent | 回收率是物料比例而非材料性能合格率~Recovery is a material fraction rather than a performance acceptance rate | 粗料質量與獨立性能試驗~coarse mass and independent property tests | 高回收率也可能保留脆弱顆粒~A high recovery fraction may retain weak particles
補充新道碴需求~Fresh ballast requirement | demand[t]=95; recovered[t]=72 | demand-recovered | t | 需求扣除合格回料才得到新料需求~Fresh demand is required material minus qualified recovered material | 可用回料與設計斷面~usable recovered material and required section | 把全部粗料視為合格會低估新料~Treating all coarse material as qualified understates fresh demand
含水率乾重換算~Moisture dry-mass conversion | wet[kg]=110; w[1]=0.1 | wet/(1+w) | kg | 含水率以乾質量為分母時，濕質量須除一加含水率~For moisture content on a dry-mass basis, divide wet mass by one plus moisture ratio | 濕重及乾燥後質量~wet mass and mass after drying | 混用濕基與乾基含水率會破壞物料平衡~Mixing wet-basis and dry-basis moisture corrupts mass balance
篩分通過比例~Sieve passing fraction | passing[kg]=18; sample[kg]=120 | passing/sample*100 | percent | 通過質量除樣本乾重描述指定篩級~Passing mass divided by sample dry mass describes one specified sieve class | 篩前篩後稱量~weighing before and after sieving | 篩網堵塞會讓細料被錯列為粗料~Screen clogging misclassifies fines as coarse material
散裝體積換算~Bulk-volume conversion | mass[t]=40; bulk[t/m3]=1.6 | mass/bulk | m3 | 散裝密度包含顆粒間空隙，不能改用岩石本體密度~Bulk density includes interparticle voids and cannot be replaced by solid-rock density | 料斗體積與質量~hopper volume and mass | 用岩石密度會低估運輸與暫存體積~Solid-rock density understates transport and storage volume
清篩處理速率~Screening throughput | mass[t]=80; time[h]=0.5 | mass/time | t/h | 物料處理率需明確時間窗並扣除等待~Processing rate needs a defined time window and treatment of waiting | 連續秤重與運轉時間~continuous weighing and operating time | 短時峰值不代表整班處理量~A short peak rate does not represent shift production
細料新增損傷~New fines from breakage | before[kg]=5; after[kg]=9; total[kg]=100 | (after-before)/total*100 | percent | 前後細料差可檢查清篩過程是否產生額外破碎~Change in fines checks whether processing generated additional breakage | 同批料前後粒徑~before-and-after grading of the same batch | 不同取樣位置會被誤認為破碎增量~Different sampling positions can imitate breakage growth
滲透流量比較~Permeability flow comparison | Q[m3/s]=0.0001; A[m2]=0.02; i[1]=0.5 | Q/(A*i) | m/s | 流量反算滲透率須記錄水力梯度與試體斷面~Inferring permeability from flow requires hydraulic gradient and specimen area | 水頭與流量穩定區段~stable intervals of head and flow | 空氣滯留會使初期流量不能代表穩態~Trapped air makes initial flow unrepresentative of steady flow
未回收物料比例~Unrecovered material fraction | lost[t]=3; feed[t]=100 | lost/feed*100 | percent | 未回收量可以包含秤重誤差、濺散與滯留，不能直接判定偷漏~Unrecovered quantity can include weighing error, spillage and retained inventory; it does not identify a cause by itself | 秤重校正與存量盤點~scale calibration and inventory reconciliation | 把所有差額當成廢料會掩蓋量測問題~Labelling every discrepancy as waste hides measurement faults''')

C(345,'structure','扣件預壓彈性絕緣與疲勞的共同設計~Fastener preload resilience insulation and fatigue design',
 '扣件同時控制鋼軌位置、提供彈性支承與維持電氣條件，增加夾持力並不保證所有性能改善；墊片、彈條與錨定件的路徑需分開辨認~Fastenings locate the rail, provide resilient support and maintain electrical conditions; increasing clamping force does not improve every property, so pads, clips and anchors need separate load-path interpretation',
 '模型彈簧、力位移曲線及隔離低壓電阻量測~model springs, force-displacement traces and isolated low-voltage resistance measurements',
 '線彈性等效元件與恆溫低載試驗，不取代產品型式試驗~linear equivalent components and constant-temperature low-load tests, not product qualification',
 '''墊片壓縮剛度~Pad compression stiffness | F[kN]=60; d[mm]=1.5 | F/d | kN/mm | 剛度應由指定載重區間的力位移關係定義~Stiffness should be defined over a specified loading interval | 載入卸載斜率~loading and unloading slopes | 非線性墊片用單一剛度會漏掉載重依賴~One stiffness misses load dependence in a nonlinear pad
平行支承合成~Parallel support stiffness | k1[kN/mm]=25; k2[kN/mm]=35 | k1+k2 | kN/mm | 同位移的平行支承剛度相加~Parallel supports sharing displacement have additive stiffness | 共同位移與分力~common displacement and force sharing | 支承不接觸時不能仍視為平行有效元件~A support out of contact cannot remain an active parallel element
串聯支承合成~Series support stiffness | k1[kN/mm]=40; k2[kN/mm]=80 | k1*k2/(k1+k2) | kN/mm | 同力的串聯元件位移相加，因此總剛度小於各元件~Series elements share force and add displacement, giving a stiffness below either element | 各層位移分量~displacement in each layer | 把串聯當平行會高估支承剛度~Treating series support as parallel overestimates stiffness
夾持力平均壓力~Clamping mean pressure | F[kN]=20; A[mm2]=2000 | F*1000/A | MPa | 平均壓力描述名義接觸區，彈條接觸邊緣可更高~Mean pressure describes nominal contact while clip-contact edges can carry more | 接觸印跡與力~contact imprint and force | 偏斜安裝造成局部壓力集中~Skew installation concentrates local pressure
彈條位移能量~Clip elastic energy | k[N/mm]=1000; d[mm]=2 | 0.5*k*d**2/1000 | J | 線性彈簧儲能與位移平方相關~Linear spring energy depends on displacement squared | 卸載回復曲線~unloading recovery trace | 塑性變形使能量不再完全可回復~Plastic deformation makes stored work partly irrecoverable
橫向剪切變形~Lateral shear displacement | F[kN]=12; k[kN/mm]=8 | F/k | mm | 橫向剛度與垂向剛度是不同參數~Lateral and vertical stiffness are distinct parameters | 橫向載入位移~displacement under lateral loading | 沿用垂向剛度會誤估軌距變化~Using vertical stiffness misestimates gauge movement
絕緣電阻量級~Insulation resistance scale | V[V]=12; I[A]=0.00002 | V/I/1000 | kohm | 低壓電阻檢查可比較濕乾狀態但不證明高壓絕緣能力~Low-voltage resistance compares wet and dry states but does not certify high-voltage insulation | 同電壓下乾濕漏電流~dry and wet leakage current at equal voltage | 表面污染會形成旁路導電~Surface contamination creates a conductive bypass
溫度膨脹相容~Thermal expansion compatibility | alpha[1/K]=0.00008; L[mm]=150; dT[K]=30 | alpha*L*dT | mm | 聚合物元件熱伸長須與金屬夾持幾何一起檢查~Polymer expansion must be checked against metal-clamping geometry | 溫度與夾持間隙~temperature and clamping clearance | 熱膨脹差可能改變預壓~Differential thermal expansion can change preload
循環損傷指標~Cycle damage index | n1[cycles]=100000; N1[cycles]=1000000; n2[cycles]=200000; N2[cycles]=2000000 | n1/N1+n2/N2 | 1 | 線性累積損傷是教學近似而非普遍壽命定律~Linear damage accumulation is a teaching approximation, not a universal life law | 載重幅值分組與循環數~load-amplitude groups and cycle counts | 忽略載入順序與腐蝕會低估實際疲勞~Ignoring load sequence and corrosion understates actual fatigue
剛度劣化比例~Stiffness degradation fraction | k0[kN/mm]=40; k1[kN/mm]=32 | (k0-k1)/k0*100 | percent | 前後比較須保持溫度與載重區間一致~Before-after comparison requires matched temperature and loading range | 同條件基準與複測~baseline and repeat tests under matched conditions | 溫度軟化可能被誤認為永久老化~Temperature softening can be mistaken for permanent ageing''')

C(346,'dynamic','浮動道床隔振共振及附加質量效應~Floating-slab isolation resonance and added-mass effects',
 '浮動式道床利用彈性支承把軌道質量與基礎分開，低頻共振與高頻隔振同時存在；隔振效果必須指定輸入位置、輸出位置與頻率範圍~Floating slabs separate track mass from the foundation through resilient supports, creating both low-frequency resonance and high-frequency isolation; performance needs specified input and output positions and frequency range',
 '模型質塊、彈簧、加速度計與合成頻譜~model masses, springs, accelerometers and synthetic spectra',
 '單自由度線性穩態模型，未含整列車與隧道土壤耦合~a linear steady-state single-degree model, excluding full train-tunnel-soil coupling',
 '''隔振固有頻率~Isolation natural frequency | k[N/m]=4000000; m[kg]=10000 | sqrt(k/m)/(2*pi) | Hz | 固有頻率由剛度質量比的平方根決定~Natural frequency follows the square root of stiffness-to-mass ratio | 自由衰減頻率~free-decay frequency | 支承硬化會提高固有頻率~Support hardening raises natural frequency
靜載壓縮量~Static support compression | m[kg]=10000; g[m/s2]=9.81; k[N/m]=4000000 | m*g/k*1000 | mm | 靜壓縮提供剛度量級檢查，但不能直接證明動態隔振~Static compression checks stiffness scale but does not establish dynamic isolation | 靜態高度與總載重~static height and total load | 支承到底會使線性隔振失效~Bottoming out invalidates linear isolation
阻尼比估算~Damping ratio estimate | c[Ns/m]=30000; k[N/m]=4000000; m[kg]=10000 | c/(2*sqrt(k*m)) | 1 | 阻尼比將黏性阻尼相對於臨界阻尼正規化~Damping ratio normalizes viscous damping by critical damping | 衰減包絡與頻率~decay envelope and frequency | 摩擦阻尼不一定可由固定黏性係數表示~Friction damping need not match a fixed viscous coefficient
頻率比辨認~Frequency-ratio identification | f[Hz]=25; fn[Hz]=3.2 | f/fn | 1 | 激振與固有頻率的比值比任一頻率單獨更有判讀力~The forcing-to-natural frequency ratio is more informative than either frequency alone | 輸入頻譜與模態頻率~input spectrum and modal frequency | 只看峰值幅度會漏掉共振移動~Amplitude alone can miss a shifted resonance
力傳遞率估算~Force transmissibility estimate | r[1]=3; zeta[1]=0.1 | sqrt(1+(2*zeta*r)**2)/sqrt((1-r**2)**2+(2*zeta*r)**2) | 1 | 線性力傳遞率含共振分母與阻尼路徑~Linear force transmissibility contains a resonance denominator and damping path | 輸入力與基礎反力~input force and foundation reaction | 過大阻尼在高頻可增加傳遞~Excess damping can increase high-frequency transmission
支承數量分力~Load per isolator | m[kg]=10000; g[m/s2]=9.81; n[count]=8 | m*g/n/1000 | kN | 均勻分力只適用對稱幾何與重心位置~Equal support load requires symmetric geometry and centre of mass | 各支承壓縮與反力~compression and reaction at each support | 重心偏移使單支承過載~A shifted centre of mass overloads individual supports
剛度不均分力~Unequal-stiffness force share | F[kN]=100; k1[kN/mm]=30; k2[kN/mm]=20 | F*k1/(k1+k2) | kN | 同位移支承中較硬者承受較大力~The stiffer support carries more force when displacement is shared | 支承高度與剛度~support height and stiffness | 只檢查總剛度會漏掉局部過載~Checking total stiffness alone misses local overload
間隙餘量檢查~Clearance reserve | gap[mm]=40; static[mm]=24; dynamic[mm]=6 | gap-static-dynamic | mm | 靜壓縮與動態振幅都消耗同一間隙~Static compression and dynamic amplitude consume the same clearance | 最小間隙與峰值位移~minimum clearance and peak displacement | 異物橋接會旁路隔振支承~Foreign material can bridge and bypass the isolation support
積水附加質量~Water added mass | rho[kg/m3]=1000; A[m2]=20; h[m]=0.03 | rho*A*h | kg | 排水不良會增加質量且改變固有頻率~Poor drainage adds mass and changes natural frequency | 水位與模態頻率~water depth and modal frequency | 積水也可能形成額外接觸阻尼~Standing water can create additional contact damping
頻率降低敏感度~Frequency reduction sensitivity | k[N/m]=4000000; m[kg]=10000; dm[kg]=1000 | sqrt(k/(m+dm))/(2*pi) | Hz | 增加質量會降低頻率，但也增加靜態壓縮~Added mass lowers frequency while increasing static compression | 載重前後頻率與高度~frequency and height before and after added load | 只追求低頻會忽略剩餘行程不足~Pursuing low frequency alone ignores insufficient travel reserve''')
